From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Sargison <sargo@sargo.cc>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 08:40:40 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 60/68] Plutonium: an agent sees and uses a window's popups

A window snapshot draws the window's open popups (menus) over it, the
image growing right and down to hold them. An agent's pointer event on
a popup goes to the popup's surface, and a press outside them closes the
ones holding a grab, as a real press outside would. Plutonium.getWindowPopups
lists them.
